==Strategy==
With the variously typed Behemoths in this stage, [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayers]] and generalist midrangers will make up the bulk of your loadout. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] in particular is very effective.

The danger of this stage comes from the abundance of Formicidaean Ariants burrowing and threatening to destroy your units. Bringing the Default or Holy Blast Cannon is recommended to reset their long foreswing. Additionally, [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] is very valuable here, as her chance to slow Zombies can give you more time to take down the Ariants.

Be sure to bring midrangers who outrange the H. Nahs, such as [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] or the aforementioned Housewife Cat. Their high DPS when stacked also allow you to kill the Ariants more quickly.

Research Power Up [[Cat Combo]]s also work here to further increase your DPS, especially with Courier Cat.

